# Cyrius port. Cargo.lock is tracked on purpose: rust-old/Cargo.lock (and
# scripts/oracle/Cargo.lock, once it exists) pin the oracle's dependency graph.
# `target/` above also covers rust-old/target, rust-old/fuzz/target and
# scripts/oracle/target.
/rust-old/fuzz/corpus/
/rust-old/fuzz/artifacts/
/rust-old/**/__pycache__/
/rust-old/benchmarks.md
/build/
